        },
        {
          "text": "Omung'oosi aaba ne alomaloma mu lisina lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala niko aloma se kakholekha tawe, aba se buli burume bwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe. Omung'oosi oyo akhoya alomalome mu bunyali bwewe omwene, mala mukhamuria niye tawe.”",
